Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<span style="font-weight:600">Definite integral demo</span>
<span id="demoNarration" style="display:block;margin:0;font-size:10px;max-width:180px;line-height:1.3"></span>
<span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px"><button onclick="prevStep()">◀</button><span id="stepLabel"></span><button onclick="nextStep()">▶</button></span>
